@startuml
title Activity 02 - External Transfer (network settlement style)
start
|CustomerApp|
:Initiate external transfer;
:Select ACCOUNT and BENEFICIARY;
|TPS|
:Validate limits, balance, and cut-off;
|Compliance|
:Run AML/sanctions screen;
if (Cleared?) then (yes)
  :Approve instruction;
else (no)
  :Create compliance hold;
  stop
endif
|TPS|
:Create TRANSFER and reserve funds;
|Gateway|
:Submit payment instruction;
repeat
  :Poll settlement status;
repeat while (Status pending?) is (yes)
if (Status success?) then (yes)
  |TPS|
  :Post debit and fees;
else (no)
  |TPS|
  :Release reserved funds;
  :Mark TRANSFER failed;
  stop
endif
fork
|TPS|
:Publish accounting and reconciliation events;
fork again
|CustomerApp|
:Show final transfer status;
fork again
|NotificationService|
:Send transfer receipt;
end fork
stop
@enduml
